## Lennard-Jones Argon Parameters (Rahman, Phys Rev, 136, A405, 1964)

vdwtype                 LENNARD-JONES
radiusrule              GEOMETRIC
radiustype              SIGMA
radiussize              DIAMETER
epsilonrule             GEOMETRIC

atom             3    Ar   "Argon Atom Ar"    18     39.948     0

vdw              3                  3.405      0.2381
